OL,3,GNEWSAMum's perforated bowel ordeal
OL,4,Aafter scan error
OL,5,
OL,6,F"No-one should have to go through what
OL,7,FI did after having a baby," said
OL,8,FNatalie Chubb after a harrowing
OL,9,Fpost-birth ordeal.
OL,11,FOn 11 January 2023, she welcomed her
OL,12,Fbaby girl into the world by caesarean
OL,13,Fsection at Birmingham's Good Hope
OL,14,FHospital, but the newborn bliss soon
OL,15,Fturned sour and she was left needing
OL,16,Femergency surgery for a perforated
OL,17,Fbowel.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
