OL,3,GNEWSAMum's perforated bowel ordeal
OL,4,Aafter scan error
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I knew something wasn't right after
OL,7,FBrooke was born, but it felt like my
OL,8,Fconcerns weren't being taken
OL,9,Fseriously," the 37-year-old from
OL,10,FSolihull said.
OL,12,FA University Hospitals Birmingham
OL,13,Fspokesperson said the Trust "is
OL,14,Fcommitted to providing safe,
OL,15,Fhigh-quality care" to all patients and
OL,16,Fto "learning from when things do not go
OL,17,Fas expected."
